{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14106250","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14106250","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1410625001:0":{"text":"因度厄，我已经听说了……你要为了某些虚无缥缈的原因，背叛萨洛克兰吗？","source_cn":"因度厄，我已经听说了……你要为了某些虚无缥缈的原因，背...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC925684A4AC79DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410625002:1":{"text":"我没有背叛，而且那是真相。斐利尔的死，龙的蛋，这些都是真的，不是吗？","source_cn":"我没有背叛，而且那是真相。斐利尔的死，龙的蛋，这些都是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0227A04EE8C9007E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410625003:0":{"text":"但这些还不够，远远不够，我还想看到更多的真相。","source_cn":"但这些还不够，远远不够，我还想看到更多的真相。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A8CE1A9F941FBAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410625004:0":{"text":"蛋从哪里来，龙在哪里，为什么你们要隐藏，为什么斐利尔会因此丧命？","source_cn":"蛋从哪里来，龙在哪里，为什么你们要隐藏，为什么斐利尔会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF337FACCFB41040C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410625005:0":{"text":"我明白了，年轻人，你迫切地想要为挚友的去世找到更说得过去的理由。","source_cn":"我明白了，年轻人，你迫切地想要为挚友的去世找到更说得过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A4C5A1B23A5350C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","docume